f blue tiles remains the same, which is 13. Therefore, the difference between the total number of green tiles and the total number of blue tiles in the new figure is:\n\\[ 26 - 13 = 13 \\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{13}\n\\]",
